    "details": "In `GCCBootstrap_jll` `9.4.0+0`, the affected target artifact is `aarch64-linux-gnu` (AArch64 Linux with glibc), which ships Binutils 2.29.1. The other target artifacts ship Binutils 2.38 and are outside the affected upstream range.\n\n`stab_xcoff_builtin_type` in stabs.c in GNU Binutils through 2.37 allows attackers to cause a denial of service (heap-based buffer overflow) or possibly have unspecified other impact, as demonstrated by an out-of-bounds write. NOTE: this issue exists because of an incorrect fix for CVE-2018-12699.",
